Synonyms: Fichte, Spruce, Häcksel; 
UUID: 2966b525-8cde-39fa-869a-3b05954a3fcb
Includes the chopping of residual softwood with a stationary chopper in the sawmill. No transports for the inputs are assumed.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chopping with a large stationary chopper.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Austria is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2966b525-8cde-39fa-869a-3b05954a3fcb.xml</text>
